      "number": "778",
      "text": "778\uff0e\u628a\u4e0b\u5217\u4e58\u5f0f\u5316\u6210\u591a\u9879\u5f0f\uff1a\na\uff09$2x(x^2-7x-3)$\uff1b\nb\uff09$4b^2(5b^2-3b+2)$\uff1b\nc\uff09$-3a^3\\left(2a^2-\\frac{1}{3}ab+b^2\\right)$\uff1b\nd\uff09$(y^2-2.4y+6)\\cdot1.5y$\uff1b\ne\uff09$\\left(-2a^3+\\frac{3}{4}c^2-7ac\\right)\\cdot4ac^2$\uff1b\nf\uff09$\\frac{1}{6}ab(3a^2-6ab+12b^2)$\uff1b\ng\uff09$-(x-2x^2+3x^3-4)\\cdot0.5x^2$\uff1b\nh\uff09$(2y^3-3y^2+0.6y-5)\\cdot(-1.5y^3)$\uff0e",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
